      "title_cn": "NVIDIA DGX Spark 64GB 为开发者提供更多构建和扩展本地 AI 的方式",
      "title_en": "NVIDIA DGX Spark 64GB Gives Developers More Ways to Build and Scale Local AI",
      "title_original": "NVIDIA DGX Spark 64GB Gives Developers More Ways to Build and Scale Local AI",
      "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-02T13:00:39+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/local-ai-dgx-spark-64gb-sync/",
      "category": "chips",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "NVIDIA 宣布其 DGX Spark 将于本月推出配备 64GB 统一内存的版本，由制造商合作伙伴宏碁、华硕、戴尔、技嘉、惠普和微星提供。新 SKU 包含 DGX OS 和 NVIDIA AI 软件栈，开箱即用，可在设备上私密运行本地智能体而无需依赖云，两台设备可通过 NVIDIA Sync Cluster Assistant 集群而无需额外设置。DGX Spark 结合了 NVIDIA Grace Blackwell 计算、统一内存、NVIDIA ConnectX-7 网络和 CUDA 加速的 AI 软件栈。",
      "what_happened_en": "NVIDIA announced that its DGX Spark will be available with 64GB of unified memory this month from manufacturer partners Acer, ASUS, Dell, Gigabyte, HP and MSI. The new SKU includes DGX OS and the NVIDIA AI software stack ready to use from day one, runs capable local agents on device privately without cloud dependency, and two units can cluster together via NVIDIA Sync Cluster Assistant without additional setup. DGX Spark combines NVIDIA Grace Blackwell compute, unified memory, NVIDIA ConnectX-7 networking and a CUDA-accelerated AI software stack.",
      "why_it_matters": "新配置为开发者、研究人员和 AI 爱好者提供了一个本地 AI 平台，用于智能体、推理、微调、数据科学和边缘开发，具有隐私保护且不依赖云，并支持集群以扩展工作负载。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The new configuration gives developers, researchers and AI enthusiasts a local AI platform for agents, inference, fine-tuning, data science and edge development, with privacy and no cloud dependency, and clustering support for scaling workloads.",
