      "title_cn": "宣布 Cloudflare OHTTP 网关——扩大对 Cloudflare 隐私保护基础设施的访问",
      "title_en": "Announcing Cloudflare OHTTP Gateway – expanding access to Cloudflare’s privacy-preserving infrastructure",
      "title_original": "Announcing Cloudflare OHTTP Gateway – expanding access to Cloudflare’s privacy-preserving infrastructure",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-02T13:00:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/announcing-cloudflare-ohttp-gateway/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 宣布推出 Cloudflare OHTTP 网关，将于今年秋季作为区域的付费附加组件推出。客户只需点击几下即可启用并开始接收 OHTTP 流量，并可通过表单注册加入候补名单。Oblivious HTTP (OHTTP) 是一项 IETF 标准，旨在使应用后端能够接收 HTTP 请求而不看到用户 IP 地址，请求通过两个独立运营的跳转：中继和网关。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare announced the Cloudflare OHTTP Gateway, launching this fall as a paid add-on to a zone. Customers can enable it with a few clicks and start receiving OHTTP traffic, and can register through a form to join the waitlist. Oblivious HTTP (OHTTP) is an IETF standard designed to enable app backends to receive HTTP requests without seeing user IP addresses, with requests traveling through two independently-operated hops: a relay and a gateway.",
      "why_it_matters": "该网关扩大了对隐私保护基础设施的访问，帮助开发者将隐私融入应用，使应用后端能够接收 HTTP 请求而不看到用户 IP 地址。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The gateway expands access to privacy-preserving infrastructure, helping developers bake privacy into apps so app backends can receive HTTP requests without seeing user IP addresses.",
