      "title_cn": "Cloudflare 可观测性的 8 项重大更新",
      "title_en": "8 major updates to Cloudflare Observability",
      "title_original": "8 major updates to Cloudflare Observability",
      "source": "Cloudflare Blog",
      "published_at": "2026-10-02T13:00:00+00:00",
      "original_url": "https://blog.cloudflare.com/one-observability-platform/",
      "category": "internet",
      "original_language": "en",
      "what_happened": "Cloudflare 推出了八项重大更新，将日志、追踪、分析、警报、仪表板和导出整合到一个可观测性平台中，定价更简单且更可预测。更新包括：一个探索 Cloudflare 各处日志的地方、从 Cloudflare 边缘到源站的端到端追踪、一个用于查询 Cloudflare 数据的统一 SQL API、一个针对 Cloudflare 中摄取和存储的可观测性数据的定价模型、自定义警报、您域名的所有分析集中一处并保留 30 天数据、自定义仪表板，以及 Logpush 数据导出现已在自助服务计划中提供。",
      "what_happened_en": "Cloudflare launched eight major updates that bring logs, traces, analytics, alerts, dashboards, and exporting into one observability platform with simpler and more predictable pricing. The updates include one place to explore logs from across Cloudflare, end-to-end tracing from Cloudflare's edge to your origin, one unified SQL API for querying Cloudflare data, one pricing model for observability data ingested and stored across Cloudflare, custom alerts, all analytics for your domain in one place with 30 days of data retention, custom dashboards, and data export with Logpush now available on self-serve plans.",
      "why_it_matters": "统一平台以可预测的定价简化了跨 Cloudflare 产品的可观测性，使调查跨多个产品的问题更加容易。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "The unified platform simplifies observability across Cloudflare products with predictable pricing, making it easier to investigate issues that span multiple products.",
